#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/mqtt/mqtt-in-python.rst:2
msgid "MQTT in Python"
msgstr "MQTT in Python"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/mqtt/mqtt-in-python.rst:4
msgid ""
"The bundled :mod:`mqtt` module on every networked OpenMV cam wraps the MQTT "
"wire protocol in one class, :class:`mqtt.MQTTClient`. The class opens the "
"TCP socket, performs the CONNECT handshake, packs and unpacks the byte-level"
" packets, handles PINGREQ keepalive, and dispatches incoming PUBLISH "
"messages to a callback. Application code calls :meth:`connect`, "
":meth:`publish`, :meth:`subscribe`, and :meth:`wait_msg` / "
":meth:`check_msg`."
msgstr ""
"De meegeleverde :mod:`mqtt`\\ -module op elke OpenMV-cam met netwerk verpakt"
" het MQTT-wire-protocol in één klasse, :class:`mqtt.MQTTClient`\\ . De "
"klasse opent de TCP-socket, voert de CONNECT-handshake uit, pakt de byte-"
"niveau-pakketten in en uit, handelt PINGREQ-keepalive af en verdeelt "
"binnenkomende PUBLISH-berichten naar een callback. Applicatiecode roept "
":meth:`connect`\\ , :meth:`publish`\\ , :meth:`subscribe` en "
":meth:`wait_msg` / :meth:`check_msg` aan."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/mqtt/mqtt-in-python.rst:12
msgid "A publisher in fifteen lines"
msgstr "Een publisher in vijftien regels"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/networking/mqtt/mqtt-in-python.rst:14
msgid ""
"The smallest useful program is a single publish. Connect, publish one "
"message, disconnect::"
msgstr ""
"Het kleinste nuttige programma is een enkele publish. Verbinden, één bericht"
